- Do not touch `docs/scenarios.yaml` (the registry), `tests/calc/calc_test.go` (generated), `tests/calc/scenarios/scenarios.go`, or anything under `services/`.
- Do not weaken, widen, or re-anchor the existing `^the number is (\d+)$` or `^the result is (\d+)$` patterns; the new pattern must stay disjoint from them so every step still matches exactly one definition.
